I can't be bothered to sourcedive, but I guess the algorithm of 
generating hiding monsters will sometimes put an item on top of the 
monster so it can hide.  If this "sometimes" is only chosen once for a 
crowd of monsters, then if a crowd of garter snake is generated, either 
each will be given an item to hide under or none will, and you saw the 
former case, twice.

